autoware-model-downloader-1-7-1 (1.7.1-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: download the Autoware 1.7.1 ML models into a
    user-owned directory instead of bundling them in the local repository.
  * models.tsv was generated from tasks.yaml by 1.9.0's genpkg.py
    (--manifest-only, with 1.9.0's groups.yaml); the 1.7.1 model set is
    frozen, so it is not regenerated by this version's build.

